# Clarinetto in B-flat I, -2 octaves, baseline targets. Pass 4: 1/4 runs thinned to 1/2 notes on the half-beat grid (the first note of each pair sustained); targets under 50 Hz moved up an octave (the valve did not hold them); tensions corrected by pass 2's measured error on notes of 130 Hz and up; beans*2 at the pre-silence and at beats 16, 32, 48; digest on.
